    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽大家～好久不见呀！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目主要是和大家唠唠最近生活的一些事（内含一点小抱怨，慎点）和对2022的小总结，以及推荐了两部爆米花真人秀和一个心理学频道～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> </span><strong><span>part1</span></strong><span>.混乱的三个月：钱包大出血！心情大emo！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="441">07:21</a> </span><strong><span>part2</span></strong><span>.调整心理状态的爆米花真人秀：</span><strong><span>《粉雄救兵》和《卡戴珊家族》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="845">14:05</a></span><strong><span> part3</span></strong><span>.2022年印象最深刻的事情和2023的关键词；推荐一个心理学频道：</span><strong><span>雪力的心理学笔记</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1287">21:27</a> </span><strong><span>part4</span></strong><span>.听首歌放松一下吧！take it easy！都会好起来的！</span><strong><span>BGM:Laid Back-ReN</span></strong></p>]]></description>
